WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Start at the house, zone zero. Think about what you visit most often.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Put the kitchen garden by the door in zone one. You visit it every day.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Keep fruit trees close in zone two. You tend them most days.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The main crop field sits farther out in zone three. Visit it when needed.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Visit the woodlot in zone four now and then. Leave zone five wild.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Let water, slopes and paths shape the zones. Use the zones that fit your land.
